{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Look like a master hacker. Type like a caffeinated squirrel.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the &quot;I'm in&quot; simulator designed for one purpose: <strong>making you look like a high-stakes cyber-criminal</strong> while you're actually just typing &quot;asdfghjkl&quot; over and over. No networking degree required, just a laptop and crowded cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the gameplay involves you typing nonsense commands and pretending to be an &quot;I'm in&quot; type of hacker. And when it comes to hacking, just randomly spam your keyboard at the target speed to bypass fake security and watch as totally-legit-looking code floods your screen. Complete with unnecessary sci-fi bleeps and bloops, because that's definitely how cybersecurity works.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Effortless Hacking</strong>: Feel like a genius by simply typing easy commands on screen! Hack networks, steal valuable data, and navigate through cyberspace with intuitive keyboard controls. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/f3b73737f611875e2f3e7c571e505408.poster.avif?t=1772562962\" width=600 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/f3b73737f611875e2f3e7c571e505408.webm?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/f3b73737f611875e2f3e7c571e505408.mp4?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Puzzles:</strong> Unlock target security with satisfying visual challenges.<strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/d8ef7657976d86fdfc1888fcd23c4e55.poster.avif?t=1772562962\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/d8ef7657976d86fdfc1888fcd23c4e55.webm?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/d8ef7657976d86fdfc1888fcd23c4e55.mp4?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay:</strong> Balance your actions against the rising System Alert. Push your luck to grab more loot, or play it safe and escape with what you've got!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/364de7b8db430ad2d4c8d6d532da1e93.poster.avif?t=1772562962\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/364de7b8db430ad2d4c8d6d532da1e93.webm?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/364de7b8db430ad2d4c8d6d532da1e93.mp4?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Sessions</strong>: Each hacking run is a unique challenge. How deep can you penetrate before the system locks you out?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/888057f94c91eaea8537736c669986bc.poster.avif?t=1772562962\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/888057f94c91eaea8537736c669986bc.webm?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/888057f94c91eaea8537736c669986bc.mp4?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and Upgrade</strong>: Collect CHIP DATA to unlock new hacker OS types, command lines, and powerful upgrades between sessions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/1c41446674430ba82bddeafda33ae5db.poster.avif?t=1772562962\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/1c41446674430ba82bddeafda33ae5db.webm?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292980/extras/1c41446674430ba82bddeafda33ae5db.mp4?t=1772562962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual gamers looking for an accessible hacker game yet thrilling experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi enthusiasts who've always wanted to live out their hacker dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone seeking a fun and engaging way to improve their typing skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No coding experience required \u2013 just bring your imagination and good keyboard. Can you become the most notorious hacker in the cyberpunk underworld?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot up <strong>Hacky</strong> now and leave your mark on the digital frontier!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hacky 1.0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3292980/732a9738878714bc5ac2784c160bb64370809cc4.jpg"},{"name":"Hacky Alpha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3292980/34daab260240a0aee8ae